;논문-무논문 과정 간 상호변경 신청 안내</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 2014-2학기 대학원(산업, 교육 및 컨설팅) 무논문 석사과정 신청안내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014학년도 2학기 기준 본교 산업 및 교육대학원 3학기차 또는 컨설팅대학원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 2학기차 재학생으로서 무논문 석사과정을 신청하고자 하는 학생은 소정의 기간 내에 관련 서류를 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;가. 신청대상 : 산업 및 교육대학원 3학기차 재학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 컨설팅대학원 2학기차 재학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; ※ 휴학 후 복학생은 반드시 복학신청 완료 후 신청</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;나. 신청기간 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #000080; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014. 08. 25(월) ~ 08. 28(목)</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;다. 신청장소 : 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;라. 신청서류 : 대학원별 무논문 석사과정 신청원 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; ※ 학적부-학적자료조회-성적에서 성적 조회 후 기재</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 2014-2학기 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">대학원(산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 논문-무논문 간 상호변경</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">신청안내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014학년도 2학기 기준 본교 산업 및 교육대학원 4학기차 또는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">컨설팅대학원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 3학기차 재학생으로서 논문과정과 무논문과정 간의 상호변경을</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">신청하고자 하는 학생은 아래의 내용을 숙지하신 후 소정의 기간에 관련서류를</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;가. 신청대상 : 산업 및 교육대학원 4학기차 재학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;컨설팅대학원 3학기차 재학생</span></p><p style=\"LI